References: bsc#1012628
Patch-mainline: 7.3.6
Git-commit: cd2cfe4d1504342b37c3170d290aa8168deff6d7

[ Upstream commit cd2cfe4d1504342b37c3170d290aa8168deff6d7 ]

[Why&How]
Refactor to make DCE support optional.

